A '''Cabbie''' (Japanese: '''タクシードライバー''' ''Taxi Driver'') is a type of {{DL|Pokémon Trainer|Trainer class}} introduced in [[Generation VIII]]. They are pilots working for the [[Flying Taxi]] and, fittingly, specialize in {{type|Flying}} Pokémon. In the {{gal|Battle Tower}} and [[Generation IX]], Cabbies specialize in {{type|Steel}} Pokémon as well.
