===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|JN}}====
Cabbies appeared in ''[[JN099|Battling Turned Up to Eleven!]]'' and ''[[JN115|Curtain Up! Fight the Fights!]]'' in [[Galar]], piloting {{p|Corviknight}}.

===''Pokémon Horizons: The Series''===
Paldean Cabbies appeared in ''[[HZ015|Someone We Can't See! Whosawhatsit?]]'' and ''[[HZ097|The Prankster]]'', both times transporting {{an|Iono}}.

A Galarian Cabbie appeared in ''[[HZ109|Tinkatuff's Hammer Wasn't Made in a Year!]]'', where he was hired to transport [[Coral]] and [[Sidian]] to Paldea. He initially refused, until he saw Coral. During the flight, they were shot down by [[Dot's Tinkatuff]]. After spotting Tinkatuff, the Cabbie and his Corviknight fled in terror.
{{-}}

===Pokémon: Twilight Wings===
[[File:Cabbie TW.png|thumb|250px|A Cabbie in [[Pokémon: Twilight Wings]]]]
A Cabbie, referred to as a '''Taxi Driver''' (Japanese: '''タクシーの運転手''' ''Taxi Driver'') in this miniseries, is a recurring character and the only character to appear in all eight episodes of the miniseries. 

The Taxi Driver debuted in ''[[TW01|Letter]]'', where he took [[Rose]] and [[Oleana]] to a hospital as part of a scheduled visit.

In ''[[TW02|Training]]'', he took [[Bea]] to the [[Wild Area]] so she could train. By the end of the episode, he returned to deliver Bea her phone, which she accidentally left behind in the taxi.

In ''[[TW03|Buddy]]'', he was delivering [[Hop]]'s {{p|Wooloo}} back home after it got lost and was found by [[Milo]], only for it to jump down when it saw Hop down below. As he proceeded to take both Hop and Wooloo home, he tried talking about their bond, only to discover the two of them had fallen asleep.

In ''[[TW04|Early-Evening Waves]]'', he took [[Nessa]] to Rose's office so she could meet with Oleana, and then to [[Wyndon Stadium]].

In ''[[TW05|Assistant]]'', he took Chairman Rose and Oleana back to their office after a long day of work.

In ''[[TW06|Moonlight]]'', he took [[Allister]] and {{gal|Tommy}} to the hospital {{gal|John}} was staying at so that Tommy could apologize to him for their earlier quarrel.

In ''[[TW07|Sky]]'', multiple Taxi Drivers transported children from the hospital to the stadium for [[Leon]]'s match. Soon after, the recurring Taxi Driver took {{gal|John}} to the stadium, but he landed them on a mountain when John spotted Leon on top of it. The Taxi Driver sent Leon and John to the stadium alone on his Corviknight so that they could arrive in time despite the heavy headwinds. The day after the match, the Taxi Driver was reading a newspaper article about the match between Leon and [[Raihan]] when {{ga|Victor}} and {{ga|Gloria}} approached him and asked him for a ride.

In ''[[TW08|The Gathering of Stars]]'', the recurring Taxi Driver took Leon all across the Galar region as he handed out invitation letters for the [[Galarian Star Tournament]]. Another Taxi Driver and his Corviknight was also seen outside Wyndon Stadium.

