* Cabbie Geoffrey mentions an old legend that says that [[Galar]] would be doomed if {{p|Corviknight}} were to disappear. This is a reference to a real-life myth about the {{wp|ravens of the Tower of London}}, which states that if they were to disappear, the {{wp|Great Britain}} would fall.

